{"id":"d26d12747335da16","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix.md","title":"Markov 模式的恒等挑战实现","display":"ex-dialectica-markov-matrix — Markov 模式的恒等挑战实现","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix","aliases":["72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix"],"display":"ex-dialectica-markov-matrix — Markov 模式的恒等挑战实现","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]","[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §2.3 MP′ and §3.1.2, print347,352/PDF359,364; explicit matrix calculation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-dialectica-markov-matrix — Markov 模式的恒等挑战实现"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d5d9a828cab1327\" href=\"?note=4d5d9a828cab1327\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles\">72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §2.3 MP′ and §3.1.2, print347,352/PDF359,364; explicit matrix calculation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\)</span>，x:σ 为指定变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:=\\operatorname{MP}_x(\\theta)\">\\(P:=\\operatorname{MP}_x(\\theta)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d5d9a828cab1327\" href=\"?note=4d5d9a828cab1327\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles\">72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</a>。Dialectica 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfc104a5d3297ad\" href=\"?note=0dfc104a5d3297ad\" title=\"72-df-dialectica-translation\">72-df-dialectica-translation</a>，a:σ 为新鲜挑战变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_\\sigma:=\\lambda a^\\sigma:\\sigma.a,\\qquad\nw(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\sigma\\rangle,\\qquad c(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_\\sigma:=\\lambda a^\\sigma:\\sigma.a,\\qquad\nw(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\sigma\\rangle,\\qquad c(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_0\\vdash P_D(I_\\sigma;a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_0\\vdash P_D(I_\\sigma;a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>¬∀xθ 的 Dialectica 见证是一个挑战值 a，使 ¬θ(a) 成立；结论 ∃x¬θ 的见证同样是一个 σ 值。蕴涵翻译只需把前者原样交给后者，矩阵化简为 ¬θ(a)→¬θ(a)。这解释了“解释验证某个非构造原则”与“原直觉主义理论可证明该原则”之间的区别，不含对高型反例的搜索算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","status":"resolved","id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dialectica-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","status":"resolved","id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$，x:σ 为指定变量；$P:=\\operatorname{MP}_x(\\theta)$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]。Dialectica 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]，a:σ 为新鲜挑战变量。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dialectica-translation","status":"resolved","id":"0dfc104a5d3297ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$，x:σ 为指定变量；$P:=\\operatorname{MP}_x(\\theta)$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]。Dialectica 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]，a:σ 为新鲜挑战变量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"P:=\\operatorname{MP}_x(\\theta)","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\sigma:=\\lambda a^\\sigma:\\sigma.a,\\qquad\nw(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\to\\sigma\\rangle,\\qquad c(P)=\\langle\\sigma\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"T_0\\vdash P_D(I_\\sigma;a).","display":true}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-ch